/* 

  HPD intervals in Picat.

  HPD (Highest Posterior Density).

  For comparison, also shown is the - generally wider - exact credible 
  intervals  for a probability distribution (i.e. not the data).

  Cf my Gamble model gamble_credible_interval.rkt

  This program was created by Hakan Kjellerstrand, hakank@gmail.com
  See also my Picat page: http://www.hakank.org/picat/

*/

import ppl_distributions, ppl_utils.
import util.
% import ordset.

main => go.


